@page "/roof-replacement-cost-charlotte-nc"
@{
    ViewData["Lang"] = "en";
    ViewData["SeoEn"] = "/roof-replacement-cost-charlotte-nc";
    ViewData["SeoEs"] = "/es/costo-de-reemplazo-de-techo-charlotte-nc";
}
<main class="resource-site" lang="en">
    @await Html.PartialAsync("_SeoIntentHeader")
    <section class="resource-hero systems-hero">
        <div class="site-shell">
            <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Roof replacement cost Charlotte NC</p>
            <h1>Roof Replacement Cost in Charlotte, NC</h1>
            <p>Replacement cost depends on squares (roof size), pitch, complexity, material, tear-off, decking repairs, ventilation and access. Use the homepage planner for a ballpark, then confirm with a measured inspection. We do not publish a fake “average price” that pretends every Charlotte roof is the same.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a class="button button-gold" href="/#planner">Open the cost planner</a>
                <a class="button button-ghost" href="/roof-replacement-charlotte-nc">Replacement overview</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="resource-body section" id="process">
        <div class="site-shell resource-sections">
            <article><span>01</span><div>
                <h2>What drives the number</h2>
                <p>Architectural shingles versus premium or metal, number of stories, chimneys, valleys, skylights and whether decking is sound. Storm work does not automatically mean insurance pays the full replacement. The carrier decides. Majestic prices the construction.</p>
            </div></article>
            <article><span>02</span><div>
                <h2>How to use the planner honestly</h2>
                <p>The planner on the home page is a range tool, not a bid. After you enter size and material, request an inspection so the written scope matches the roof. Pair this page with <a class="official-link" href="/repair-or-replace-roof">repair vs replace</a>, <a class="official-link" href="/roofing-systems-charlotte-nc">systems</a> and <a class="official-link" href="/roof-installation-charlotte-nc">installation</a>.</p>
            </div></article>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="faq-section section" id="faq">
        <div class="site-shell faq-layout">
            <div><p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p><h2>Cost questions</h2></div>
            <div class="faq-list">
                <details><summary>How much does a new roof cost in Charlotte, NC?<span>+</span></summary><p>There is no honest single number without squares, pitch and material. Use the planner, then inspect. Beware of quotes that skip tear-off, flashing or ventilation.</p></details>
                <details><summary>Does insurance pay for a full roof replacement?<span>+</span></summary><p>Only if the policy and the carrier’s decision support it. Age, wear and matching rules still apply. Documentation is not a payment.</p></details>
                <details><summary>Can I finance a replacement if insurance does not pay?<span>+</span></summary><p>Financing is discussed only when a real option exists for that project. It is never a reason to file a claim.</p></details>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    @await Html.PartialAsync("_SeoIntentFooter")
</main>
